          "quote": "Slow down. Stop if necessary. Give way to traffic on major road"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "starter.stop.yield-after-stopping",
      "ruleIds": ["stop-before-stop-line"],
      "paragraphs": [
        "The STOP control is on your lane only. The car on the local road is not asked to stop for you, whether you stopped first or not.",
        "After your stop you give way to traffic from the right and the left. The local-road car goes first; you go when the road is clear."
      ],
      "termIds": ["stop-sign", "stop-line"],
